          "desc": "packages/main/src/handlers/story-dispatch.ts:330 supplies the unconditional promptRoleContract(agentType) when assembling the new Inventory completeness only dispatch. packages/main/src/core/prompt-role-contract-registry.ts:341 still requires topology-critic-receipt for this role, while the new role body explicitly says inventory completion does not issue topology receipts and must return after review_inventory_critic_set. Thus the actual full envelope simultaneously requires and forbids a topology receipt for the exact repaired express workflow, whose topology implementation provenance is absent. This directly contradicts the Story promise of inventory-only instructions and can stop a contract-following critic. Bind the required output contract to the selected responsibility, retaining strict topology requirements for topology dispatch, and assert the full assembled inventory envelope. This is a verified prompt-contract contradiction; no separate runtime requiredOutputIds gate or topology proof bypass is claimed."
